      "category": "readability",
      "severity": "note",
      "problem": "英文前文一直对读者用 you，此处突然出现 “whether he means to stay”，指代对象不清。中文无此问题。",
      "evidence": [],
      "proposed": "改为 “force the question of whether you mean to stay into an open negotiation”。"
